{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25454","headline":"早春至言禅公法堂忆平泉别业 · 李德裕","name":"早春至言禅公法堂忆平泉别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔我伊原上，孤游竹树间。\n人依红桂静，鸟傍碧潭闲。\n松盖低春雪，藤轮倚暮山。\n永怀桑梓邑，衰老若爲还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}